    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT15_INTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Penny! You remember \"Wave Stalling\"?",
              "zh": "潘妮！你还记得“拖过波”吗？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I was wonderin' — to pull off Wave Stalling, do we gotta completely avoid attackin' the current wave of zombies?",
              "zh": "我在想，如果要完成“拖过波”，一定完全不能攻击当前波次的僵尸，是这样吗？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Not exactly. In reality, the next wave is only drawn in once the previous wave zombies are damaged to an extent",
              "zh": "并非如此。实际上只有僵尸们的血量下降到一定程度时，才会引来下一波僵尸。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "In other words, you just need to keep the damage dealt to the zombies within a certain range — you don't have to avoid attacking them entirely.",
              "zh": "也就是说，把对僵尸造成的伤害控制在一定范围内即可，并不需要完全不攻击僵尸。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "So what's that range?",
              "zh": "那么这个范围是多少呢？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "My calculations show that to keep the next wave from coming early, the current wave's total health needs to stay above a certain threshold. That threshold shifts between 50% and 65%.",
              "zh": "根据我的计算，想要不提前引来下一波僵尸，需要使本波次僵尸血量保持不低于某个比例，这个比例在50%至65%间浮动。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "In other words: \"you can knock off about one-third of each wave safely without triggering the next wave.\"",
              "zh": "也许这听起来很难懂，换个简单的说法就是“每波可以打掉三分之一的血量不会过波”。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "For example, if a wave has three zombies with equal health points, you can kill one of them with no risks of triggering the next wave early.",
              "zh": "比如某一波来了三个血量相同的僵尸，可以击杀其中一个，这不会使下一波僵尸提前进攻。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "That's mighty useful know-how!",
              "zh": "很有用的知识！"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT15_INTRO2"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "To avoid triggering the next wave early, you need to keep the current wave's toughness above a certain percentage. That percentage fluctuates between 55% and 65%.",
              "zh": "想要不提前引来下一波僵尸，需要使本波次僵尸血量保持不低于某个比例，这个比例在55%至65%间浮动。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "That might sound confusing, so put simply: \"you can knock off about one-third of each wave's toughness without triggering the next wave.\"",
              "zh": "也许这听起来很难懂，换个简单的说法就是“每波可以打掉三分之一的血量不会过波”。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "For example, if a wave has three zombies with equal toughness, you can kill one of them without causing the next wave to attack early.",
              "zh": "比如某一波来了三个血量相同的僵尸，可以击杀其中一个，这不会使下一波僵尸提前进攻。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT15_OUTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I've come up with a name for \"the percentage of the current wave's health points that must be kept from dropping below to prevent the next wave from attacking early.\"",
              "zh": "我给“不使下一波僵尸提前进攻所需的本波次僵尸血量保持不低于的比例”起了个名字。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "......",
              "zh": "……"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I've decided to call it the \"Wave Trigger Health Percentage.\"",
              "zh": "我决定叫它“过波血线”。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "As a reminder, the Wave Trigger Health Percentage usually fluctuates between 50% and 65%.",
              "zh": "再次提醒：在一般情况下，“过波血线”是50%至65%间的浮动值。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
